Jupanakaruw Diosan markap contra saytʼapjjañapatak wiytani . Jichhürunakanjja parlañatakisa , Diosar yupaychañatakisa maynejj derechoniwa sasaw yaqhep gobiernonakajj sapjje .
Diosax pantjasitanaka juchanaka pampachirïtapa ukat Jupar munasirinakarusa , istʼirinakarus yanaptʼirïtapxa janiw Davitax armaskänti , jiwasax jupjamarakiw taqi ukanak jan armañasäkiti .
Diosan arsutanakapa ukat profecianakap phoqasirïtapjja sumwa israelitanakajj yatipjjäna .
