Susana : Uk amuytʼañajaspawa .
Biblia liytʼasajja , jumajj ukhamarakiw Jehová Diosan arunakaparjam sarnaqañ munasma .
Ukhamatwa Jesusajj aka ñanqha pachar tʼunjir jutkani ukhajj qhespiyistani . Kunjamtï mä chachajj Jesusar siskäna ukhamarakwa jiwasajj saraksna : “ ¡ Yanaptʼitay jukʼamp iyawsañajjataki ! ” sasa .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapatakixa , maynit maynikam munasipxäta siski uka kamachixa janiw aliq arsüwikïkiti .
