Jupajj kuntï aka Oraqetak amtki ukan sum jakasiñasatakiw wakichtʼaskistu , niyaw ‘ taqe kunsa Criston munañapankañapataki ’ alajjpachankirinaksa aka Oraqenkirinaksa mayachthapini , ukhamat mä familjam servipjjañapataki , uka amtapasti phoqasipuniniwa ( Efesios 1 : 9 , 10 liytʼañataki ) .
