Jaqenakan sum istʼapjjañapatakejja , suma arunakampiw parlañasa . Ukham parlapjjañapatak Bibliat yateqerinakar yanaptʼañäni ukhajja , jupanakajj kusisitaw yatiyapjjani .
Ukarakiw jan walin uñjaskasas kusisitäñatak yanaptʼäna .
